{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NRX2AeKU6B1mi8C5yB5bZ9","type":"tool_result","content":"README.md\nnotes/a-cache-header-tweak-served-my-whole-site-as-octet-stream.md\nnotes/badges-for-your-users-achievements.md\nnotes/collecting-leads-with-apps-script.md\nscripts/deploy.sh\nsrc/assets/logo.png\nsrc/assets/mark.svg\nsrc/booking.js\nsrc/clases.html\nsrc/index.html\nsrc/styles.css\n# ruta-ceramica site\n\nStatic site for a ceramics studio: plain HTML, one CSS file, one JS file\n(the class booking widget). Hosted on S3 behind CloudFront.\n\n- `src/` — the site as served (no build step; `scripts/deploy.sh` copies it up)\n- `scripts/deploy.sh` — upload to the bucket and invalidate CloudFront\n\nDeploy: `./scripts/deploy.sh` (needs AWS CLI configured with the studio profile).\n\nKnown problem: after a deploy, returning visitors keep running the old\n`booking.js` for days. The CloudFront invalidation runs every time, but\nbrowsers never ask again, because the objects are uploaded with no\n`Cache-Control` header at all.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"570dba33-c106-44c6-b929-f944bfdd609b","uuid":"73d8e917-ead2-4ede-a1de-adf776382c50","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:15:49.471Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"README.md\nnotes/a-cache-header-tweak-served-my-whole-site-as-octet-stream.md\nnotes/badges-for-your-users-achievements.md\nnotes/collecting-leads-with-apps-script.md\nscripts/deploy.sh\nsrc/assets/logo.png\nsrc/assets/mark.svg\nsrc/booking.js\nsrc/clases.html\nsrc/index.html\nsrc/styles.css\n# ruta-ceramica site\n\nStatic site for a ceramics studio: plain HTML, one CSS file, one JS file\n(the class booking widget). Hosted on S3 behind CloudFront.\n\n- `src/` — the site as served (no build step; `scripts/deploy.sh` copies it up)\n- `scripts/deploy.sh` — upload to the bucket and invalidate CloudFront\n\nDeploy: `./scripts/deploy.sh` (needs AWS CLI configured with the studio profile).\n\nKnown problem: after a